      "text": "Mounted as /results\nRun configs, seeds, hashes, split receipts\nResidual features + frozen code logits\nv3.1: 11,755 cached training views\n(6,262 native + 5,493 Choice views)\nInitial / epoch / accepted checkpoints\nOptimizer states, histories, calibration\nPredictions, metrics + completion seals\nLegacy paths retained; aliases resolve\nvolume.commit() persists job output",
