      "locked": false,
      "text": "A100-80GB; CPU helpers as needed\nE1\u2013E6, E8\u2013E9: train heads only\nE7 exception: full-weight 9B training\nFixed seeds + per-run optimizer config\nValidation chooses checkpoint / \u03bb\nSave epoch states; promote accepted one\nE8/E9 reuse cache: no backbone load",
      "originalText": "A100-80GB; CPU helpers as needed\nE1\u2013E6, E8\u2013E9: train heads only\nE7 exception: full-weight 9B training\nFixed seeds + per-run optimizer config\nValidation chooses checkpoint / \u03bb\nSave epoch states; promote accepted one\nE8/E9 reuse cache: no backbone load",
